
% Tornado

a: IV | vi |
In: $a*2
aa: IV | vi | IV |
Vr_a: $a*2 $aa
b: vi | . V | IV |
b_sub: vi | . iii | IV |
Ch: $b $b_sub
c: IV | . V | vi | . iii |
cc: IV | . V | vi | . iii | IV |
Vr_c: $c*2 $cc
d: ii | vi | I | V |
bridge: $d*4
PostCh: $c*2
cadence: IV |
d_ending: ii | vi | I | V | IV |
S: [C] $In $Vr_a $Ch $Vr_c $Ch $bridge $PostCh $cadence $d_ending
